        "parms": "# prob — a weighted chain of states\nprob jumps from state to state. You tell it the ways out of each state as lists of three numbers, <from> <to> <weight>: 0 1 3 says that from 0 it can go to 1 with weight 3. Each bang picks one way out of the current state, the heavier ones more often, sends the new state and stays there. This is a Markov chain. prob 0 5 starts in state 0, with seed 5.\nMax prints dump in its console. Here the list comes out of the right outlet instead, one transition per message.",
