        "parms": "1. When this patch opened, loadmess and prepend stored five transitions: 0 1 3, 0 2 1, 1 0 1, 1 2 1 and 2 0 1. From 0 the chain goes to 1 three times out of four and to 2 once; from 1 to 0 or 2 alike; from 2 always back to 0.",
